    "headerCitation": "Mahasitavati vidyarajni\nBased on the edition by Yutaka Iwamoto: Kleinere Dhāraṇī Texte,\nKyoto 1937 (Beiträge zur Indologie, 2), pp. 1-6.\nInput by Klaus Wille (Göttingen)\nSTRUCTURE OF REFERENCES:\nMś_nn = pagination of Iwamoto's edition\nBOLD for references\nITALICS for restored text\n(This file is to be used with a UTF-8 font and your browser's VIEW configuration\nset to UTF-8.)\ndescription:multibyte sequence:\nlong a  ā",
